1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,220
THE STATUE OF LIBERTY

2
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,920
IS IN NEW YORK.

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:03,560
SURROUNDED BY

4
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,407
NEW JERSEY.

5
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,500
IN 1834,

6
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,140
THE TWO STATES

7
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:07,980
DREW THEIR BORDER

8
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,591
DOWN THE MIDDLE OF THE HUDSON.

9
00:00:09,891 --> 00:00:11,000
THAT LEFT TWO ISLANDS

10
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,726
ON NEW JERSEY'S SIDE.

11
00:00:13,026 --> 00:00:14,900
NEW YORK KEPT THEM ANYWAY.

12
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,320
IT'S WRITTEN

13
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,313
INTO THE DEAL.

14
00:00:16,763 --> 00:00:18,311
ON OCT 28,

15
00:00:18,311 --> 00:00:19,600
1886,

16
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,740
THE STATUE WAS DEDICATED

17
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,060
ON ONE OF THEM.

18
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,480
IN FOG AND RAIN.

19
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:24,540
THE OTHER ONE

20
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,920
WAS ELLIS ISLAND.

21
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:26,520
BACK THEN,

22
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,546
3 ACRES.

23
00:00:27,846 --> 00:00:28,220
THE GOVERNMENT

24
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,140
KEPT ADDING LANDFILL.

25
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,256
ABOUT 24.5 MORE ACRES.

26
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,060
NEW JERSEY SUED.

27
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,500
IN 1998,

28
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,280
THE SUPREME COURT

29
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,576
GAVE IT THE NEW LAND.

30
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:38,840
SO ELLIS ISLAND

31
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,371
IS IN TWO STATES.

32
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:41,500
LIBERTY ISLAND

33
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,400
GOT SOME LANDFILL TOO.

34
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:44,000
BUT THE GROUND

35
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:44,740
UNDER THE STATUE

36
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,837
IS NATURAL.

37
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,380
HER POWER AND WATER

38
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:48,140
STILL COME

39
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,606
FROM THE NEW JERSEY SIDE.

40
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:51,640
SHE STAYS IN NEW YORK.

41
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:52,400
SURROUNDED BY

42
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,234
NEW JERSEY.

